From 07d578f050296ba945e111261f75c63c5a9a9cb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: beau4201 <beau.ten.berge@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 19:28:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] sovereignos: restyle the keyboard as rounded caps

Upstream draws every key in the colour of the keyboard background, so the gaps between keys are invisible and the keys read as one surface. Each key is now its own rounded cap on a different tone with a bottom edge, the top of the keyboard is rounded, the suggestion dividers are visible, and the popups follow. The edge is the drawable padding, so a label centred on the key is centred on the cap. The action caps carry an intrinsic size because the enter and emoji keys scale their background by it. Text colours that lose contrast on the new fills are raised. Resources only; the keyboard background of the input view is moved to the window by the next patch. ADR-146.
